      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLAZING TURBO (4) comes here off a placing in fast time (25.28) over 450m at this track when beaten 5.5 lengths in a Grade 5. Should be in this for a long way. DAVE (5) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fifth (25.55) at this track latest. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Expected to give a good account. LEROY'S GIRL (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.1 lengths at Bendigo in a handy 28.56 beating Opal Whisper. Significant danger. DELATITE BEAST (2) will have admirers after surprising many with a placing last time out.",
